{"id":"41daa15018596763","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-eratosthenes.md","title":"Sieve of Eratosthenes","display":"df-eratosthenes — Sieve of Eratosthenes","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-eratosthenes","aliases":["58-df-eratosthenes","Sieve of Eratosthenes"],"display":"df-eratosthenes — Sieve of Eratosthenes","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-eratosthenes"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-eratosthenes</span><span>Sieve of Eratosthenes</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-eratosthenes — Sieve of Eratosthenes"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3322615e4eea05e9\" href=\"?note=3322615e4eea05e9\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-prime.md\">../batch20/58-df-prime.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\in\\omega\">\\(N\\in\\omega\\)</span> (upper bound)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(P\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> (candidate output)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prime}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Prime}_S\\)</span> (prime-number predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3322615e4eea05e9\" href=\"?note=3322615e4eea05e9\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-prime.md\">../batch20/58-df-prime.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SieveOutput}_S(N,P)\">\\(\\operatorname{SieveOutput}_S(N,P)\\)</span> (sieve-output predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}eratosthenes} \\vdash \\operatorname{SieveOutput}_S(N,P) \\leftrightarrow N\\in\\omega\\land N\\geq2\\land P=\\{m\\in\\omega:2\\leq m\\leq N\\land\\operatorname{Prime}_S(m)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}eratosthenes} \\vdash \\operatorname{SieveOutput}_S(N,P) \\leftrightarrow N\\in\\omega\\land N\\geq2\\land P=\\{m\\in\\omega:2\\leq m\\leq N\\land\\operatorname{Prime}_S(m)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The displayed predicate formalizes the sieve's final survivors; an operational implementation repeatedly removes proper multiples of the least surviving number.</li>\n<li>Complexity: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(N \\log \\log N)\">\\(O(N \\log \\log N)\\)</span> operations, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(N)\">\\(O(N)\\)</span> memory</li>\n<li>Modern generalizations: general number field sieve, large prime variants</li>\n<li>Brun's sieve: bound for sum of reciprocals of twin primes</li>\n<li>Selberg sieve: quadratic form method; provides upper bounds for primes in sets</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Crandall and Pomerance, Prime Numbers</li>\n<li>Tenenbaum, Introduction to Analytic and Probabilistic Number Theory</li>\n<li>Friedlander and Iwaniec, Opera de Cribro</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-prime.md","status":"resolved","id":"3322615e4eea05e9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-prime.md","status":"resolved","id":"3322615e4eea05e9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Prime}_S$ (prime-number predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"N\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prime}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SieveOutput}_S(N,P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}eratosthenes} \\vdash \\operatorname{SieveOutput}_S(N,P) \\leftrightarrow N\\in\\omega\\land N\\geq2\\land P=\\{m\\in\\omega:2\\leq m\\leq N\\land\\operatorname{Prime}_S(m)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"O(N \\log \\log N)","display":false},{"tex":"O(N)","display":false}],"bytes":1364,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-492","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-eratosthenes.md|58-df-eratosthenes]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["3322615e4eea05e9"]}